@anon.8ad231a129453d088979dfad2582f60a.1289 = private unnamed_addr constant [19 x i8] c"missing-todo-author", align 1
@anon.8ad231a129453d088979dfad2582f60a.1290 = private unnamed_addr constant [440 x i8] c"## What it does\0AChecks that a TODO comment includes an author.\0A\0A## Why is this bad?\0AIncluding an author on a TODO provides future readers with context around\0Athe issue. While the TODO author is not always considered responsible for\0Afixing the issue, they are typically the individual with the most context.\0A\0A## Example\0A```python\0A# TODO: should assign an author here\0A```\0A\0AUse instead\0A```python\0A# TODO(charlie): now an author is assigned\0A```\0A", align 1
